docs/ADOPTION.md:534:  `changeSetSha` drift, return/path mismatch, and changed history/anchor/config. Restore or
docs/ADOPTION.md:575:| Audit open exits 6 / `config-change-unaccepted` | a prior run detected a config change | inspect `git diff .claude/doc-audit.json`; after approving it, run `/docaudit:audit --accept-config` |
docs/ADOPTION.md:576:| Verdict is `REFUSED` | gate could not validate the run snapshot | follow `reason`; representative values include evidence SHA mismatch, lock/run identity mismatch, manifest not sealed, HEAD/worktree drift, `changeSetSha` mismatch, return mismatch, or changed history/anchor/config |

